{
 "_doc": "Warbound story skill trees (campaign heroes, slow persistent levelling to 40). Each class learns from three trees: its archetype's two trees and its faction's tree. Every tree has 8 nodes in 4 rows: 3 actives (row 1, row 2 and the ultimate in row 3) and 5 passives. A row opens once enough points are spent in that tree (row_points). A passive is a talent (talent.type from StoryTrees.TALENTS, one value per rank: a share, an amount, seconds, or 'every Nth') and/or an army aura (mods: ItemCatalog stats per rank); 'icon' names its passive icon. Active nodes teach a skill from heroes.json (3 ranks, ultimates 1). The class signature is known from level 1 and can be ranked up too. A story hero slots 3 basic skills (Q W E) and 1 ultimate (R). See src/sim/story_trees.gd and src/sim/story_hero.gd.",
